  "body": "Tender: Closes on Tuesday 15 December 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\n16 Abbotsford Terrace is a much-loved home cherished by the same family for 23 years, a wonderful testament to the family life it has offered. Set on a quiet road with little through traffic, and with many neighbouring homes beautifully restored and renovated, the setting feels rather special. With a floor area of 208m² the home sits on a lovely 696m² section with an unusually wide frontage. The property is fully fenced and offers\r\noff-street parking for two or more vehicles.\r\n\r\nThe original home welcomes you with a wide central hallway and beautiful native timber floors. Three bedrooms and a bathroom branch off the hallway, along with a cosy room with a working open fireplace, currently used as a dining room.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the hallway, the home opens into a generous kitchen and family lounge. A large character window brings light and sunshine into the kitchen, while the open-plan living flows onto a deck for alfresco dining, a lovely spot to relax and watch the children playing in the garden.\r\n\r\nExtended 11 years ago to accommodate the owners’ children, the home now offers five bedrooms and three living areas. The extension was thoughtfully designed to give a growing family space and separation. A few stairs lead up to two bright bedrooms and a bathroom, while two short flights down take you to another lounge, a favourite gathering place for the children and their friends. Sliding doors open directly to the backyard, keeping this space\r\nconnected to the garden.\r\n\r\nAll living areas flow outside to the sunny, north-facing garden. With big, open spaces to run, play and explore, it recalls the backyards many of us remember from childhood, space that can be hard to find today. If a swimming pool is on your wish list, there is plenty of room to explore adding one. Abundant grapevines and a peach tree add to its appeal, with the owners telling us the fruit is wonderful each year.\r\n\r\nThe flexible layout offers plenty of options for families who need room to grow or want to share with extended family. Now that the children have grown and mostly left home, the owners are ready for another family to enjoy everything they have loved here.\r\n\r\nDevonport Village, the ferry and beaches are an easy walk away, along with local primary schools. Nearby playing fields and walking and cycling tracks offer even more opportunities to get outdoors and enjoy this wonderful neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nA home full of character, space and happy memories, ready for its next family chapter.",
